{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/354976-can-a-loyalist-have-court-mantle","id":354976,"title":"Can a Loyalist have Court Mantle?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-30T12:14:52-08:00","id":354976,"title":"Can a Loyalist have Court Mantle?","content":"While reading Night Horrors: Grim Fears, I noticed that Maya has mantle (Spring 3).<br /> <br /> I was under the impression that the Courts were created to confuse and help defend the Lost from the Others and that you have a supernatural connection with the Season itself, with mantle being a mix of social status and that supernatural connection, gained through upholding the tenants of said Court, where Spring (or Summer or another one) could reward you with mantle directly.<br /> <br /> It seems kinda weird that Spring is going to cast a Loyalist in a good light (the Season, not the Court).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4284-metalgogo","name":"metalgogo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T15:54:57-08:00","id":355193,"title":"","content":"from what I understand of Maya, she is pretending to be an upstanding changeling in society, there are rumors about dark stories...but nothing concrete. Essentially if nobody can prove that she is doing something evil, she is all good in the court.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2127-eltacolibre","name":"Eltacolibre","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2127_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T17:57:41-08:00","id":355269,"title":"","content":"I think the problem lays in (at least 1e) Mantle not adequately saying how much of it is social/political, and how much of it is spiritual. I kind of never liked having the two linked because of things like this.<br /> <br /> If you're running the game with Mantle as mostly Status with some supernatural perks, Maya's stats make perfect sense.<br /> <br /> If you're running the game with Mantle as mostly supernatural with the side effect of social respect, it doesn't.<br /> <br /> If you're trying to play it as a balance of these two things, it kinda makes sense either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T20:08:05-08:00","id":355362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>metalgogo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/354976-can-a-loyalist-have-court-mantle#post354976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While reading Night Horrors: Grim Fears, I noticed that Maya has mantle (Spring 3).<br /> <br /> I was under the impression that the Courts were created to confuse and help defend the Lost from the Others and that you have a supernatural connection with the Season itself, with mantle being a mix of social status and that supernatural connection, gained through upholding the tenants of said Court, where Spring (or Summer or another one) could reward you with mantle directly.<br /> <br /> It seems kinda weird that Spring is going to cast a Loyalist in a good light (the Season, not the Court).</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/298980-\u200bhow-seasons-communicate-with-the-lost?p=299441#post299441\">Autumn Nightmares.</a><br /> <br /> The Courts are not the conceptual entities they draw power from, those being facets of the Wyrd that the Lost have leveraged pledgecraft with to the end of establishing systems of power based on qualities that determine who's an &quot;appropriate&quot; leader for a freehold in a fashion incomprehensible to the Gentry. This doesn't stop loyalists from having Mantle \u2014 they're not the Fae.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 12-30-2014, 11:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T10:32:17-08:00","id":355858,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the replies.<br /> That clears it up a bit.<br /> <br /> I have another question, though.<br /> What if someone turns loyalist while being an active member of a court? Can he still raise his mantle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4284-metalgogo","name":"metalgogo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T10:58:24-08:00","id":355874,"title":"","content":"The seasons care not what a Lost does in pursuit of their mantle. Loyalist, privateer, or Mad, if you fight well and are close to your wrath, Summer will have you. It's just filling its part of the bargain - to empower the lost and confuse the Gentry in its turning. If the Lost choose to use that at cross purposes, well... That's not Summer's concern, is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T12:36:29-08:00","id":355973,"title":"","content":"With that, I have no more questions about mantle.<br /> <br /> Thanks all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4284-metalgogo","name":"metalgogo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}